 "about_text": "Chris Sharp Gallery is a contemporary art gallery in Los Angeles, founded in January 2021 by writer and curator Chris Sharp, co-founder of the Mexico City project space Lulu. The program mixes emerging, mid-career, and historically overlooked artists, with a core group based in Los Angeles alongside artists working on the East Coast, in the UK, and in Europe. The gallery favors fully integrated practices in which ideas, politics, and materials are inseparable, giving weight to personal, idiosyncratic sensibilities, humor, and craft, presented with careful spatial attention. Chris Sharp serves as owner and director, supported by a small staff handling operations and exhibitions. The gallery is located on Santa Monica Boulevard and participates regularly in international art fairs.",
